WEBVTT

00:01:59.000 --> 00:02:00.976
havikuwepo kwa wingi

00:02:01.000 --> 00:02:03.869
Na haikuwa rahisi kuvipata
kama vya kigeni


00:02:03.893 --> 00:02:06.976
Lakini sababu ya waandishi
kama Chinua Achebe na Camara Laye

00:02:07.000 --> 00:02:10.976
Nilipata badiliko la akili
ninavyoiona fasihi

00:02:11.000 --> 00:02:13.214
Niligundua kwamba watu kama mimi,

00:02:13.238 --> 00:02:15.245
wasichana weusi

00:02:15.269 --> 00:02:18.531
wenye nywele ngumu

00:02:18.555 --> 00:02:20.365
pia wapo katika fasihi.

00:02:20.682 --> 00:02:23.976
Nilianza kuandika 
vitu nilivyovifahamu

00:02:24.737 --> 00:02:27.976
Nilikuwa navipenda hivyo vitabu
vya Marekani na Uingereza

00:02:28.000 --> 00:02:31.976
Viliamsha fikra zangu
Vilifunua vitu vipya.